	(text "RTC (replaces DS3231 ZS-042 module)\nU401 DS3231MZ+TRL, I2C address 0x68, +/-5 ppm (SOIC-8). Register-compatible upgrade: DS3231SN#T&R (LCSC C9866, SOIC-16, +/-2 ppm).\nBT401 CR2032 is a primary cell: no charge path (the ZS-042's 200R + 1N4148 charger is deliberately removed).\nThe module's AT24C32 EEPROM (0x57) is not fitted. I2C pull-ups are on esp32-core.\nINT/SQW is open drain: R401 10k pull-up to +3V3 -> RTC_INT. 32KHZ and RST are not used.\nPCB: the battery holder is nickel-plated steel, keep it >= 20 mm from the magnetometer."
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "870f51f0-08c1-4433-b0a9-2debd17b7852")
	)
	(label "RTC_VBAT"
		(at 119.38 101.6 0)
		(effects
